<title>HONG KONG: Beijing Dev 1996 net loss HK$26.29 mln.</title>
<headline>Beijing Dev 1996 net loss HK$26.29 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  30.7 loss  vs 7.6 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   nil	  vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 2.07 gain  vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			   26.29 loss vs 6.48 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		    102.08     vs 100.93</p>
<p>    Company name		Beijing Development (Hong Kong) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Beijing Development is a maker of woollen and worsted products.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$2.76 million on partial disposal of interest in a subsidiary, gain of HK$4.3 million on transfer of fixed assets as capital contribution to an associated company and loss of HK$4.98 million from severance payment and long service payment upon termination of the Hong Kong manufacturing operation.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs 5.5 H.K. cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
